{"id": "EUVD-2026-106916", "enisaUuid": "9d7aaaff-912f-3f9f-8ffa-e047823a9a32", "description": "Sharp before 0.35.0 bundles a version of libvips affected by multiple vulnerabilities (CVE-2026-33327, CVE-2026-33328, CVE-2026-35590, CVE-2026-35591 and CVE-2026-69242) in its GIF, TIFF and VIPS image decoders. Attackers can supply crafted GIF, TIFF or VIPS files to applications using sharp to process untrusted input, triggering these libvips flaws.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T00:37:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T00:37:11", "baseScore": 8.4, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:H/SC:L/SI:H/SA:H", "references": ["https://github.com/lovell/sharp/security/advisories/GHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/sharp-before-0.35.0-multiple-vulnerabilities-via-bundled-libvips-image-decoders"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-114113", "GHSA-7vv3-w8cj-2245"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0939c29f-3f47-3862-bb6e-d87df2b55ae2", "product": {"name": "sharp", "vendor": {"name": "code16"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.35.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3f9f9776-c88a-3aed-9a6a-1da36d07f20a", "vendor": {"name": "lovell"}}], "isExploited": false}